omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dBa8oXXyr7AQ7kNvwGCj00P&_nc_oc=Ado0rtmCKVVQwHSthpVE5MA2qdTTJ-tLIl6k8whtNUnw3iOk20a851yaanze37RQmSE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5jRhFzOxp9msGKLqxZGZDRTR3dceAKFAvfFKKPJ9u-gQ&oe=69FDFFB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P7IsVzYofikQ7kNvwFmbJ8h&_nc_oc=Adq-GZe9z0F68P-1ydqMLGe4FF4JxuDwLXtfvHLS3o6MWl4-htI5COwq5YLkRvyzlgE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6D6AgNh7-SJyw-kzt8N6C3UD8MSZSbLRumPlBWYcpPoA&oe=69FE0116"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0CuLm3DpuyoQ7kNvwHAVk0m&_nc_oc=AdpLeoCuA93EdOFSskaddF1ARVTlPQ0kSlz2kuzH6l_ikZLpJnJvuBmrI8erF8SkLqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5jALpvRRJxM19a3ZAHLmTl2w9LArCmmgE3Dmofbg5sgQ&oe=69FDDDF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://